	"name": "Greenlord",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/nature/leaf-oak-wreath-glow-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You have supplemented the traditional druidic training with focused study and have come away more powerful for it. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Constitution, Intelligence, or Wisdom score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with Nature or an expertise die if you are already proficient. You also learn two skill specialties of the Nature skill. They do not count against your skill specialties known.</p></li><li><p>You learn an additional wild shape form. It does not count against your number of wild shape forms known.</p></li><li><p>Choose a 1st- or 2nd- level druid spell with at least one rare variant. You cannot select a spell of the Summoning school for this benefit. You learn a rare variant of the selected spell for free. You only need to prepare the base version of the selected spell and can choose to cast either the rare or base variant as you see fit when casting it.</p></li></ul>",
